{"title": "HP Reverb G2", "parts": {"lead": "<p class=lead>VR headset from HP with four 640×480 grayscale tracking cameras and an IMU at about 1 kHz. This solve uses the cam0 and cam1 pair from the Monado SLAM calibration data.</p><div class=chips><span class=chip>4 cameras</span><span class=chip>cam0 + cam1 solved</span><span class=chip>1 kHz IMU</span><span class=chip>CC BY 4.0</span></div>", "glance": "<div class=band><figure class=demo><video src=\"/media/hero/hero_mgc_960.mp4\" poster=\"/media/hero/hero_mgc_960.jpg\" autoplay muted loop playsinline controls preload=metadata></video><figcaption>Recovered by MVIS from the Monado calibration data.</figcaption></figure><div class=v data-v=\"0\"><div class=tiles><div><span>Reprojection median</span><b>0.13<small> px</small></b></div><div><span>cam0–cam1 baseline</span><b>108.5<small> mm</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 td</span><b>−1.25<small> ms</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 lever arm</span><b>53.8<small> mm</small></b></div></div></div></div>", "process": "<p>The solved path of the rig around the board. Press Play or drag the bar to follow the calibration. Camera images are left out to keep the page small.</p><div class=v data-v=\"0\"><div class=procplot id=\"proc0\"></div><div class=\"mvis-progress\" data-plot=\"proc0\"><button type=button>▶ Play</button><select class=\"mvis-progress-cam\" aria-label=\"Camera shown\"><option value=\"0\">cam0</option><option value=\"1\">cam1</option></select><input type=range min=0 max=599 value=599 step=1 aria-label=\"Calibration progress\"><span class=\"mvis-progress-label\">Loading</span></div></div>", "map": "<p>Solved positions and orientations, to scale in the IMU frame. Drag sideways to orbit. Tap a sensor for its values.</p><div class=map><div class=stage><canvas id=rig tabindex=0 aria-label=\"3D map of the cameras and IMU\"></canvas><div class=tools><button data-view=iso type=button>3D</button><button data-view=front type=button>Front</button><button data-view=top type=button>Top</button><button data-view=side type=button>Side</button><button data-z=1 type=button aria-label=\"Zoom in\">+</button><button data-z=-1 type=button aria-label=\"Zoom out\">−</button></div></div><div class=panel><div class=picks id=picks></div><div id=info></div></div></div>", "hardware": "<div class=scroll><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Value</th><th>Source</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Cameras</td><td>4 × 640×480 grayscale at 30 Hz</td><td><span class=chip>Dataset</span></td></tr><tr><td>IMU</td><td>About 1 kHz</td><td><span class=chip>Dataset</span></td></tr><tr><td>Sensor part numbers</td><td>Not published</td><td><span class=chip>Unknown</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=note>Company: <a href=\"https://www.hp.com/\">HP</a>.</p>", "dataset": "<div class=two><div class=scroll><table><tbody><tr><td>Recording</td><td>Monado MGC, imucalib01, round 1</td></tr><tr><td>Source</td><td>Monado SLAM Datasets, Collabora</td></tr><tr><td>Board</td><td>AprilGrid 6×6, tag 30 mm, spacing 0.3, t36h11</td></tr><tr><td>Licence</td><td>CC BY 4.0</td></tr><tr><td>Data</td><td><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/collabora/monado-slam-datasets\">Monado SLAM Datasets</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><svg class=board viewBox=\"-4.5 -4.5 234.0 252.0\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AprilGrid layout to scale\"><rect x=\"0.00\" y=\"0.00\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"/><rect x=\"39.00\" y=\"0.00\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"/><rect x=\"78.00\" y=\"0.00\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"/><rect x=\"117.00\" y=\"0.00\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"/><rect x=\"156.00\" y=\"0.00\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"/><rect x=\"195.00\" y=\"0.00\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"/><rect x=\"0.00\" y=\"39.00\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"/><rect x=\"39.00\" y=\"39.00\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"/><rect x=\"78.00\" y=\"39.00\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"/><rect x=\"117.00\" y=\"39.00\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"/><rect x=\"156.00\" y=\"39.00\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"/><rect x=\"195.00\"