 those edges have no figure.</p>", "imu": "<div class=v data-v=\"0\"><p>Scale as deviation from 1. Model: calyx. Gyro-to-accel time offset <code>t_ga</code>: +2.54 ± 0.20 ms.</p><div class=bars><div class=bar><span>Gyro scale x</span><i><u style=\"left:50.00%;width:1.11%\"></u></i><b>+0.18 %</b></div><div class=bar><span>Gyro scale y</span><i><u style=\"left:50.00%;width:1.16%\"></u></i><b>+0.18 %</b></div><div class=bar><span>Gyro scale z</span><i><u style=\"left:50.00%;width:0.27%\"></u></i><b>+0.04 %</b></div><div class=bar><span>Accel scale x</span><i><u style=\"left:50.00%;width:4.88%\"></u></i><b>+0.78 %</b></div><div class=bar><span>Accel scale y</span><i><u style=\"left:50.00%;width:7.56%\"></u></i><b>+1.21 %</b></div><div class=bar><span>Accel scale z</span><i><u style=\"left:50.00%;width:6.04%\"></u></i><b>+0.97 %</b></div><div class=bar><span></span><em><s>−8 %</s><s>0</s><s>+8 %</s></em><b></b></div></div></div>", "timing": "<p>Offsets to scale, with t_imu = t_cam + td.</p><div class=v data-v=\"0\"><div class=chart><svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 136\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Time offsets in milliseconds, to scale\"><line class=\"g\" x1=70.0 x2=70.0 y1=4 y2=112 /><text x=70.0 y=128 text-anchor=middle>-10 ms</text><line class=\"g\" x1=177.5 x2=177.5 y1=4 y2=112 /><text x=177.5 y=128 text-anchor=middle>-5 ms</text><line class=\"g z\" x1=285.0 x2=285.0 y1=4 y2=112 /><text x=285.0 y=128 text-anchor=middle>+0 ms</text><line class=\"g\" x1=392.5 x2=392.5 y1=4 y2=112 /><text x=392.5 y=128 text-anchor=middle>+5 ms</text><line class=\"g\" x1=500.0 x2=500.0 y1=4 y2=112 /><text x=500.0 y=128 text-anchor=middle>+10 ms</text><text x=0 y=22>cam0 td</text><line class=stem x1=285.0 x2=258.1 y1=18 y2=18 /><circle class=dot cx=258.1 cy=18 r=5 /><text x=249.1 y=22 text-anchor=end>−1.25</text><text x=0 y=56>cam1 td</text><line class=stem x1=285.0 x2=258.0 y1=52 y2=52 /><circle class=dot cx=258.0 cy=52 r=5 /><text x=249.0 y=56 text-anchor=end>−1.25</text><text x=0 y=90>t_ga</text><